1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,424
Bonjour, Adrien ! Tu as ton passeport ?
Hello, Adrien! Do you have your passport?

2
00:00:05,924 --> 00:00:08,780
Oui, il est dans mon sac.
Yes, it's in my bag.

3
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:11,536
Et tes billets d'avion ?
And your plane tickets?

4
00:00:12,036 --> 00:00:16,116
Les voilà ! Nous partons pour Paris !
Here they are! We're leaving for Paris!

5
00:00:16,616 --> 00:00:21,200
Super ! Où est notre porte d'embarquement ?
Great! Where is our boarding gate?

6
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:24,436
C'est la porte numéro douze.
It's gate number twelve.

7
00:00:24,936 --> 00:00:27,240
À quelle heure est le vol ?
What time is the flight?

8
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,020
À dix heures trente.
At ten thirty.

9
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:35,056
Vite ! Nous devons passer la sécurité !
Hurry! We have to go through security!

10
00:00:35,556 --> 00:00:38,748
Ne t'inquiète pas, nous avons le temps !
Don't worry, we have time!

11
00:00:39,248 --> 00:00:42,632
J'espère que le vol sera agréable !
I hope the flight will be pleasant!

12
00:00:43,132 --> 00:00:46,876
Moi aussi ! Bon voyage !
Me too! Have a good trip!

